  "content": "<p>此附加組件讓您更深入地沉浸在中世紀的氛圍中，因為它為原始模組添加了大量來自13至16世紀歐洲各地的全新盔甲、武器與裝飾品。</p><p><strong>完全鍍金模板罕見由盔甲匠村民出售</strong><br>此專案需要安裝&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights</a> 模組及其所有依賴項。大多數紋理與模型由粉絲創作。特別感謝 SuperSus890 和 SteveMc 的最大貢獻。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1441/931/armor-1-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"984\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1452/66/armor-2-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"984\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1441/938/armor-3-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"984\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1039/408/weapons.png\" width=\"1400\" height=\"864\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/543/decorations-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"1573\"></p>",
